# The app images now build FROM SOURCE inside a JDK 25 build stage (see
# deploy/app/Dockerfile), so the build context must include the source tree.
# Keep it lean by excluding VCS, host Gradle/build outputs (rebuilt in-image),
# and node artifacts (node-gradle re-provisions node during the container build).
.git
.gradle
**/.gradle
**/build
**/node_modules
**/*.log
.idea
dist
